            "SeoDescription": "Data Acquisition is technology used to convert real-world data into digital information. Products in this category include analog-to-digital converters (ADCs), digital-to-analog converters (DACs), special purpose, analog front end (AFE), digital potentiometers, touchscreen controllers, and more.",
